!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:start the process;
:make an appointment at the hairdresser's;
:go to the hairdresser's;
:v_choice: service choice ({wash, dye, cut}); <<objectSignal>>
switch ()
case ([v_choice="wash"])
:do you need your hair washed;
:wash hair;
case ([v_choice="dye"])
:do you want your hair dyed;
:dye hair;
case ([v_choice="cut"])
:do you need a haircut;
:cut hair;
endswitch
:pay the hairdresser;
:You have completed this procedure;
stop
